# The generated capacity certificate at conductor 59

This is the residue-functional realization of the generated credit edges.
The auxiliary prime, root, orbit, and all matrix entries are computed from
the `7 → 29 → 59` tower in `Credit`; the inverse below is only a proof
certificate for the resulting generated matrix.
-/
import Fermat.FiftyNine.Conservation.Credit
import Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.FreeModule.Finite.CardQuotient

